---
source: crates/aether/tests/steps/cli/help.rs
expression: world.cli.stdout()
---
Usage: aether node admin <FLAGS>

Flags:
      --data-dir <DATA_DIR>
      --port <PORT>
      --hub-url <HUB_URL>    The Aether hub that lets people invite and connect by name. Defaults to
                             the one set on the page, else the public hub; `off` turns it off.
                             [env: AETHER_HUB_URL]
      --managed-scope
  -h, --help                 Print help
